WEBVTT

00:34:58.663 --> 00:35:02.704
We need people with the will to persist
and triumph in the face of obstacles.

00:35:03.579 --> 00:35:06.329
But when you're channeling your
inner Katniss Everdeen,

00:35:06.329 --> 00:35:08.621
Inigo Montoya or Forrest Gump,

00:35:09.038 --> 00:35:11.621
it's worth pausing to see if
you're on the wrong path

00:35:12.371 --> 00:35:17.746
because you might be Wile E. Coyote
chasing a road runner you'll never catch.

00:35:22.163 --> 00:35:24.079
Next time on Work Life, it was

00:35:24.079 --> 00:35:26.038
incredibly humbling because

00:35:26.496 --> 00:35:27.496
I would

00:35:27.496 --> 00:35:30.871
submit job after job after application
after application